WEBVTT

00:09:27.396 --> 00:09:30.608
and I decided to do
a little self-help ritual called ...

00:09:30.608 --> 00:09:32.359
“Take a note, give a note.”

00:09:33.235 --> 00:09:34.236
It’s easy.

00:09:34.236 --> 00:09:37.406
When you see someone having something
that you believe you deserve,

00:09:37.406 --> 00:09:38.407
you take a note.

00:09:38.407 --> 00:09:39.992
You ask yourself a few questions.

00:09:40.075 --> 00:09:41.869
Is it something that you really want?

00:09:42.119 --> 00:09:44.913
Perhaps that person is better suited
than you are for that.

00:09:45.706 --> 00:09:46.790
Does the universe --

00:09:46.790 --> 00:09:49.043
is the universe conspiring
for you to have that?

00:09:49.376 --> 00:09:52.296
Really kind of try and be honest
with who you are

00:09:52.296 --> 00:09:53.672
and where you’re at in life.

00:09:54.381 --> 00:09:56.508
Once you do that, you take
a deep breath --

00:09:56.508 --> 00:09:57.718
(Inhales)

00:09:57.718 --> 00:10:01.305
and you say, “Their wins
have nothing to do with my worthiness.”